uns 75 years from 1951, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. In 2025 that pair hit 31% of normal and September to October hit 28%. In 2026 so far, March to April sat at 31% and May to June at 184%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 13685 at 54%.</p>"}
